## Interview Goal

This question evaluates the ability to design a cross-platform native module with multi-threading, on-device processing, and low-latency streaming to React Native. It requires knowledge of TurboModules/JSI, memory management, and power considerations.

## Key Concepts

- React Native TurboModules and JSI bridge for high-performance native-JS communication
- Dedicated native worker thread with a ring buffer to handle backpressure
- Sensor fusion using Kalman filtering with monotonic timestamps for temporal accuracy
- Zero-copy data transfer via SharedArrayBuffer or direct buffer access
- Battery and power management with proper thread synchronization

